Going through Pod Disruption Budgets (PDB) today.

In simple words:
PDB helps make sure that a certain number of pods stay available during voluntary disruptions like node maintenance.

Simple example:

apiVersion: policy/v1
kind: PodDisruptionBudget
metadata:
  name: my-pdb
spec:
  minAvailable: 2
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: my-app

If I have 3 pods, this PDB ensures at least 2 remain available during a voluntary disruption.

